    <atom:summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="showInRuntimeViewerLink" href="adt://A4H/sap/bc/adt/runtime/dump/20260924182816vhcala4hci_A4H_00%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20DEVELOPER%20%20%20001%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%201"&gt;Show in Runtime Error Viewer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id="OVERVIEW"&gt;Contents&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;a href="#HEADERX"&gt;Header Information&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="#WHATHAPPENED"&gt;What happened?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="#ERROR"&gt;Error analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="#TERMINATION"&gt;Information on where terminated&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="#SOURCE"&gt;Source Code Extract&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="#STACK"&gt;Active Calls/Events&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h4 id="HEADERX"&gt;Header Information&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;table cellspacing="3"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Short Text&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; Division by 0 (type I or INT8) &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runtime Error&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; COMPUTE_INT_ZERODIVIDE &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Exception&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; CX_SY_ZERODIVIDE &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CP &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Date/Time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; 24.09.2026 18:28:16 (System) &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;User&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; DEVELOPER (John Doe) &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Client&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; 001 &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Host&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt; vhcala4hci_A4H_00 &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;h4 id="WHATHAPPENED"&gt;What happened?&lt;/h4&gt;Error in the ABAP application program.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The current ABAP program "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CP" had to be terminated because it found a&lt;br&gt;statement that could not be executed.&lt;h4 id="ERROR"&gt;Error analysis&lt;/h4&gt;An exception has occurred in class "CX_SY_ZERODIVIDE". This exception was not caught&lt;br&gt;in procedure "IF_OO_ADT_CLASSRUN~MAIN" "(METHOD)" or propagated by a RAISING clause.&lt;br&gt;Since the caller of the procedure could not have anticipated this&lt;br&gt;exception, the current program was terminated.&lt;br&gt;The reason for the exception occurring was:&lt;br&gt;The reason for the exception is:&lt;br&gt;In the current program "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CP", a division ('DIVIDE', '/', 'DIV' or 'MOD')&lt;br&gt;attempted to use operands of type I or INT8 to divide by 0.&lt;br&gt;by 0.&lt;h4 id="TERMINATION"&gt;Information on where terminated&lt;/h4&gt;The termination occurred in ABAP program or include "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CP", in "IF_OO_ADT_CLASSRUN~MAIN". The&lt;br&gt;main program was "SAPMHTTP".&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In the source code, the termination point is in line 3 of include "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CM001".&lt;br&gt;include "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CM001".&lt;br&gt;The termination is due to exception "CX_SY_ZERODIVIDE" occurring in procedure "IF_OO_ADT_CLASSRUN~MAIN" "(METHOD)",&lt;br&gt;but not being handled locally there or being declared in the RAISING&lt;br&gt;clause.&lt;br&gt;The procedure is in program "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CP". Its source code begins in line 1 of&lt;br&gt;include "ZCL_ADTPY_83D6E6_ERR==========CM001".&lt;h4 id="STACK"&gt;Active Calls/Events&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;style&gt;code { font-family: Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Courier, monospace; }&lt;/style&gt;&lt;table cellspacing="5"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th align="left"&gt;No.&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align="left"&gt;Event&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align="left"&gt;Program&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align="left"&gt;Include&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align="left"&gt;Line&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;12&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td